{"status":"unsupported_domain","reason":"No faithful typed AST can preserve the specified JSON input and output types in this frontend. Each edge is a heterogeneous three-element JSON array, and each output entry is an integer, null, or the exact string \"-inf\". The available sorts lack heterogeneous tuples, nullable values, and the required union type. Encoding these as records or Except values would change the observable API. The registered formulas also provide no execution-effect model for the Python purity, I/O, state, and dependency guarantees. Opaque Lean cannot satisfy the required executable Python test bridge.","affected_obligations":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","S1","S2","R1"],"required_extensions":["Faithful heterogeneous edge-array encoding","Faithful integer/null/string output-entry union","Executable graph-walk and negative-cycle reference semantics","Python execution-effect and dependency checks"],"proposal":null}